name dynamicnumber
category Package
revision 38726
shortdesc Dynamically typeset numbers and values in LaTeX through "symbolic links"
relocated 1
longdesc This package dynamically typesets values generated by different
longdesc kinds of scripts in LaTeX through the use of "symbolic links"
longdesc (which are not in any way related to the "symbolic links" used
longdesc in UNIX systems!). The aim is to reduce errors resulting from
longdesc out-of-date numbers by directly setting them in the number
longdesc generating file and importing a "symbolic link" into the LaTeX
longdesc source file. It can be used to import not only numerical
longdesc values, but strings and pieces of code are also possible.
longdesc Currently only MATLAB and Python are supported to produce
longdesc Dynamic Number list files.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/dynamicnumber/dynamicnumber.sty
